     "text": "You want a food grudge?  I got one for you. Oldie but goldie.\n\nWhen my Gran died her daughters fought for days over which one would inherit her recipe book till they finally agreed that they would share it so they opened it together & there was only 1 entry which said \"Book I pretend has recipes\""
